{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>His might.</b> Like \"all the might of.\"" "<b>And he set forth.</b> From the root פ-ר-ש, for it is not pu'al." "<b>The king.</b> Like \"one\" in reckoning, which has no equal, and the second is like the number \"two,\" and the third is under him in the third position."], :book :esther, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kol Sason, Krotoschin, 1840" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001728315"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:30:28.153219198Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}